  {
    "id": "lem-toeplitz-matrix-has-displacement-rank-at-most-two",
    "kind": "lemma",
    "title": "A Toeplitz matrix has lower-shift displacement rank at most two",
    "statement": "Let $T=(t_{i-j})_{0\\le i,j<n}$ be any square Toeplitz matrix, and let $Z=Z_n$ be the lower shift of [[def-displacement-rank-generators-and-lower-shift]]. With $e_0=(1,0,\\ldots,0)^T$ and $t_0=T_{00}$,\n$$T-ZTZ^*=e_0(e_0^*T-t_0e_0^*)+(Te_0)e_0^*.$$\nConsequently, its displacement rank is at most two. A width-two generator is\n$$G=[\\,e_0\\ \\ Te_0\\,],\\qquad H^*=\\begin{bmatrix}e_0^*T-t_0e_0^*\\\\ e_0^*\\end{bmatrix}.$$",
