ign: author two same-A-page suppliers before the force certificate, following the complete PC-EWALD local mesh supplier proof development appendix in research/numerical-analysis-four-category-scaffolds-2026-10-16/linear-audit.md and the resolved supplier section in research/plan-numerical-linear-track.md. Preserve P≥2. The negative-sign unitary FFT recovers charge coefficients with √(M_1M_2M_3)/conj(D_k); exact signed alias indices and derivative factors k+n⊙M are essential. Use the explicit derivative p-series controller for P≥3 and finite piecewise derivative-window enclosures for P=2, with a declared one-sided or symmetric derivative value at knots and no false classical-gradient claim there. Keep real/reciprocal tails, assignment/source aliases, derivative-window aliases, mesh differentiation, self correction and actual arithmetic enclosures separate. Gaussian Poisson summation consumes the published full-rank lattice Poisson theorem with Countable Choice and consistent 2π normalization. No empirical rms estimator supplies a deterministic error bound. This is a planning proof obligation, not completed authoring or review coverage.\"], \"examples\": \"neutral dipole cell, nonneutral zero-mode obstruction, alpha tradeoff at fixed tolerance, source collision, energy/force consistency.\"}",
