    "dependency_level": 4,
    "statement": "For a triangulation of the convex hull of $n$ distinct planar sites with affine dimension two, let $k$ be the number of sites on the hull boundary, $T$ the number of triangles, and $E$ the number of edges. Then\n$$T=2n-2-k,\\qquad E=3n-3-k.$$\nIn particular $T<2n$ and $E<3n$.",
