    "statement": "For $n\\ge4$ weighted sites of projected affine dimension three, the number of 3D Delaunay tetrahedra or weighted regular tetrahedra returned by the fixed formal lift is at most $n(n-3)/2$, hence $O(n^2)$. No planar $O(n)$ bound or mesh-quality guarantee is asserted.",
