          "forward_refs": [],
          "statement": "For each integer $M\\ge1$, put $H_M=\\sum_{k=1}^M1/k$. Euler's constant\n$\\gamma$ satisfies\n$$0\\le H_M-\\log M-\\gamma\\le\\frac1M.$$\nThus $[H_M-\\log M-1/M,\\ H_M-\\log M]$ is a finite enclosure for $\\gamma$."
