    "statement": "Under the hypotheses of [[def-mixed-characteristic-wave-curve]], the map\n$(\\sigma,u)\\mapsto\\Psi_i(\\sigma;u)$ is $C^1$ near $(0,\\bar u)$, with\n$\\Psi_i(0;u)=u$ and $\\partial_\\sigma\\Psi_i(0;u)=r_i(u)$.",
