nd $DC=0$ give $D\\dot b=-DCe=0$, so $Db(t)=Db(0)$ and compatible data remain divergence-free. An incompatible initial divergence is preserved, not corrected by this ODE. This is a spatial Galerkin system only; no time integrator is included. The cochain convention and weak material-interface formulation come from the declared spaces and [[def-transient-maxwell-system-with-material-interfaces]]. Smooth interpolation and a uniformly bounded commuting projection are separate prerequisites for the later error estimate and are not asserted by this definition."
