    "id": "def-signorini-contact-variational-inequality",
    "kind": "definition",
    "title": "The vector Signorini contact set and variational inequality",
    "statement": "Let $\\psi\\in C(\\Gamma_C;\\mathbb R)$ satisfy $\\psi\\le0$. Define the unilateral frictionless **contact set**\n$$K:=\\{v\\in V:T_Cv\\cdot n\\ge\\psi\\quad\\text{for arclength-almost every point of }\\Gamma_C\\}.$$\nGiven the elasticity form $a$ and bounded load $F$ of [[def-signorini-elasticity-contact-model]], the **contact variational inequality** is to find $u\\in K$ such that\n$$a(u,v-u)\\ge F(v-u)\\qquad\\text{for every }v\\in K.$$\nThe set $K$ is nonempty, closed and convex by [[lem-signorini-contact-set-closed-convex-nonempty]].",
