amples\": \"**B examples.** One-dimensional periodic neutralized charge deposition; manufactured smooth density with grid error; cold two-stream model as stipulated experiment with no claimed physical validation; failure of neutrality; leapfrog energy drift versus exact semidiscrete invariant.\"}",
