          "dependency_level": 2,
          "statement": "Let $\\Phi,\\Phi_h$ be the orientation-preserving maps of [[def-curved-domain-geometry-approximation]], with $J,J_h\\ge j_*>0$ and $\\|D\\Phi\\|_\\infty+\\|D\\Phi_h\\|_\\infty\\le M$. Set $B=J D\\Phi^{-1}D\\Phi^{-T}$ and $B_h=J_hD\\Phi_h^{-1}D\\Phi_h^{-T}$. Then $\\|B-B_h\\|_\\infty\\le C e_1$, where $C$ depends only on $d,j_*,M$. Consequently $|\\int_{\\widehat\\Omega}\\nabla v^T(B-B_h)\\nabla w|\\le C e_1\\|\\nabla v\\|_2\\|\\nabla w\\|_2$ for $v,w\\in H^1(\\widehat\\Omega)$.",
