bigl(h\\|u\\|_{H^2(\\widehat\\Omega)}+\\epsilon_{F,h}^{\\mathrm{bulk}}+\\epsilon_{\\partial,h}\\bigr).$$ where $C$ is independent of $h$. For the parabolic geometry family, $\\epsilon_{\\partial,h}\\le C_G(e_0+e_1)\\le C_Gh$.",
